# Documentation

- Plain words, short sections, and a table when a table scans faster.
- Use relative links. Document paths that exist today.
- No em dashes. No secrets.
- An issue title starts with one emoji code. A pull request title is a plain sentence.
- [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) stays the short project guide. Do not grow it into an operations manual.
